# Server Component Placement

Use this convention for server-only component files:

- Files named `*-server.tsx` must live under `app/`.
- Do not place `*-server.tsx` files under `components/`.
- Client-presentational components remain in `components/` and should be imported by server wrappers in `app/`.

## Preferred Pattern

```tsx
// ✅ app/(protected)/business-header-switcher-server.tsx
import { BusinessHeaderSwitcherClient } from "@/components/shared/header/business-header-switcher-client";
```

```tsx
// ❌ components/shared/header/business-header-switcher-server.tsx
```

When adding or moving a server wrapper:

1. Create/move the `*-server.tsx` file into an appropriate `app/...` segment.
2. Update all imports to the new `app/...` path.
3. Keep non-server UI pieces in `components/...`.
